# Frozen vector bytes must never be EOL-normalized. Files under vectors/ are
# pinned by vectors/SHA256SUMS; autocrlf conversion would silently corrupt the
# frozen set. In-repo attributes override local Git configuration so every
# consumer receives identical published bytes.
vectors/** -text
vectors/**/*.cose binary
vectors/**/*.bin binary
# Adapter declarations are pinned by the SHA-256 of their committed bytes
# (spec/adapters/README.md §2), so a checkout must not convert them either.
spec/adapters/*.md -text
